app - The root module containing all application code.

        - core : stores Configs and handels database connections 
                - config = file saves all the configs including all the singlton we want to preserve (env vars, secrets.. )
                - schema = the DB schema to init the project DB
                - database = file that handels the DB connection when a request is recieved and creates the execution cursor.

        - data_access_layer
                                - modules : classes containing the data presestance for objects in tables (a represention of tables as classes - no database logic)
                                - Represotries : classees managing the database operations for each table (trying to keep with ORM style to organize things even we using only SQL and No ORM)
        - services : services mannaging the logic before saving data to Represotries [Contains business logic (validation, workflows).]
        - routes : routes mannaging the requests for the user and sending responses

__init__.py   -> Makes the folders a Python package